       fhir:comment [ fhir:v "A clinical document typically has exactly one recordTarget participant. In the uncommon case where a clinical document (such as a group encounter note) is placed into more than one patient chart, more than one recordTarget participants can be stated." ] ;
       fhir:requirements [ fhir:v "The recordTarget(s) of a document are stated in the header and propagate to nested content, where they cannot be overridden." ] ;
